   2 text commands (one per laid-out line)
  [OK] the wrapped paragraph became more than one line
  [OK] a command carries its bytes
  [OK] ...its font id
  [OK] ...its size
  [OK] ...and a colour with full alpha
  [OK] re-rendering an unchanged panel keeps every command
  [OK] ...with the same bytes
  [OK] ...and the same baseline

